# Subagent model preference

When launching any Cursor `Task` subagent (explore, shell, generalPurpose, best-of-n-runner, etc.), always set:

```
model: claude-sonnet-5-thinking-high
```

Do not default to the parent model or pick another Claude/GPT slug unless the user explicitly requests a different model for that run.
